@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Sparse conditional constant propagation

rectangle "CodePropertyGraph\nimmutable AST + CFG + DefUse" as CPG #F1F3F5
rectangle "FunctionCfgView\ncanonical flow edges + entry" as CFG #D3F9D8
rectangle "Value cells\ndefinitions + expressions\nConstLattice" as CELLS #FFF3BF
rectangle "Flow worklist\nmark executable CFG edges" as FLOW #DBE4FF
rectangle "Value worklist\nAST parents + DefUse successors" as VALUE #E5DBFF
rectangle "Boolean constant guard?\ntrue / false / conservative both" as GUARD #FFE8CC
rectangle "SccpResult\nconstants + executable/dead edges\n+ unreachable nodes" as RESULT #C3FAE8
rectangle "ReachabilityReport\nrefine_with_sccp" as REACH #FFE3E3

CPG --> CFG : function_cfg_view
CPG --> CELLS : AST + DFG projection
CFG --> FLOW : seed function entry
CELLS --> VALUE : seed entry-owned cells
FLOW --> GUARD : executable source
GUARD --> FLOW : admitted target\nnew executable node
VALUE --> VALUE : lattice rise\nenqueue dependencies
VALUE --> GUARD : changed guard cell
FLOW --> RESULT : executable-edge set
VALUE --> RESULT : <latex>Constant(c)</latex> cells
CFG --> RESULT : scoped edge/node universe
RESULT --> REACH : add proof-backed dead paths

note bottom of CELLS
  <latex>Unknown \sqsubset Constant(c) \sqsubset Overdefined</latex>
  Distinct constants join to Overdefined.
end note

note bottom of RESULT
  Deterministic and out of graph.
  Defensive cap: <latex>4(N + D)</latex>.
  <latex>N</latex> = scope nodes; <latex>D</latex> = DefUse edges.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#F1F3F5>| immutable CPG substrate |
  |<#D3F9D8>| CFG execution scope |
  |<#FFF3BF>| DFG-backed constant cells |
  |<#DBE4FF>| executable-flow worklist |
  |<#E5DBFF>| sparse value worklist |
  |<#FFE8CC>| guard decision |
  |<#C3FAE8>| deterministic SCCP result |
  |<#FFE3E3>| reachability refinement |
endlegend
@enduml
